 219            /       C8TTYI= JMS XC8TTY
 220            /EX.    JMS XC8TTYI             /READ CHAR FROM THE CONSOL DEVICE
 221                                            /               /RETURN TO CALL PLUS ONE AC CONTAINS THE CHAR
