 229 10273 6031         KSF                     /LOOK FOR KEYBOARD FLAG
 230 10274 5273         JMP .-1
 231 10275 6036         KRB                     /GET CHAR
 232 10276 0370         AND (177                /MASK FOR 7 BITS
 233 10277 1367         TAD (200                /ADD THE EIGHTH BIT
 234 10300 3766         DCA I (C8CHAR           /STORE IT
 235 10301 1766         TAD I (C8CHAR
 236 10302 5672         JMP I XC8TTY            /EXIT
