 735            /C8CKPA
 736            /THIS ROUTINE WILL CHECK IF A CHARACTER WAS ENTERED FROM THE
 737            /TERMINAL. IF THE FLAG IS SET AND THE CONSOLE PACKAGE IS
 738            /ACTIVE A CHECK IS MADE TO DETERMINE IF IT IS A CONTROL CHAR.
 739            /IF IT WAS A CONTROL CHAR THEN ITS CONTROL FUNCTION IS PERFORMED.
 740            /IF NOT A CONTROL CHARACTER OR A CONTROL E-D-L-O- IT WILL DO
 741            /THE CONTROL FUNCTION AND RETURN TO CALL PLUS 2.
 742            /A NON CONTROL CHARACTER WILL BE PRINTED AND A "?" IT WILL RETURN TO
 743            /CALL PLUS 2.
 744            /IF NO FLAG IS SET OR THE CONSOL IS NOT ACTIVE THE RETURN IS TO
 745            /CALL PLUS 1.
